In this branch, we allow users to report a comment as offensive.
Users won't be able to report a comment more than once.
Added endpoints to report and view a report.

We can visualize all reports like this:
{
    "18": {
        "Reports for Article 18": 1,
        "Users": [
            {
                "id": 20,
                "username": "pepe",
                "email": "pepe@g.com",
                "first_name": "pepe",
                "last_name": "",
                "gender": "M",
                "birth": "2000-12-12T06:55:00Z",
                "level": "JR"
            }
        ]
    },
    "21": {
        "Reports for Article 21": 0,
        "Users": []
    }
}

Fixes #29. 

@liulex, I hope you don't mind, this was your work in your fork, but I think it's excellent stuff that is useful for all users of this plugin.

I haven't tested it thoroughly, but from the looks of it it could well be what we've all been waiting for :).

@jakubbielawa this should make your excellent plugin compatible with VS 2019 and future versions, without requiring synchronous loading of all plugins just to enable this one. Perhaps you check it out and if it's stable, merge it in?
